    <p class="about-statement">A place for <em>ideas</em><br />to take shape.</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Welcome. I’m Raul Sheth.</p>
      <p>This is where I’ll share my writing and reflections on what I read.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-links">
    <a href="/blog">
